# Used with examples/tutorial.db and a loopback-only Channel Access environment.
$BEEPSEVERITY MINOR
GROUP NULL Tutorial
$ALIAS Local alarm tutorial
$GUIDANCE
This facility uses only the local tutorial IOC.
Return the pressure value to zero, then acknowledge the channel.
$END
GROUP Tutorial Vacuum
CHANNEL Vacuum qtalh_demo:pressure -----
$ALIAS Vacuum pressure
$GUIDANCE
Set qtalh_demo:pressure to 7 for MINOR, 12 for MAJOR, and 0 for normal.
$END
